          <div class="post-header">
           <h3 class="post-title"><a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2012/03/double-super-secret-github-feature/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: Double Super Secret Github Feature">Double Super Secret Github Feature</a></h3>
           <p class="post-date">
            <span class="month">Mar</span>
            <span class="day">15</span>
           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/category/uncategorized/" title="View all posts in Uncategorized" rel="category tag">Uncategorized</a> | <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2012/03/double-super-secret-github-feature/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Double Super Secret Github Feature"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="1073 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/?p=1073">No Comments</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
